usage: forge_sol_external_evidence_rehydrate_v2_20261026.py
       [-h] --metadata METADATA --git-dir GIT_DIR --external-objects
       EXTERNAL_OBJECTS [--fixture-blobs FIXTURE_BLOBS]

Restore pinned evidence DATA blobs to an external Git object store only. Does
not edit a working tree, index, refs, primary objects or alternates file. The
caller must already have configured the external store as an alternate.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --metadata METADATA
  --git-dir GIT_DIR
  --external-objects EXTERNAL_OBJECTS
  --fixture-blobs FIXTURE_BLOBS
                        Tests only: OID-named blobs exported from a pinned
                        local fixture commit
